    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Tobin Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale this superbly located two bedroom residence circa 67m² in the heart of Carrickmacross. Suitable for a variety of uses having previously been commercial / retail and currently residential. The property is suitable for the vacant / derelict home grants and also a variety of energy upgrade schemes. \r\n\r\nFeatures include: OFCH, u.P.V.C. and wooden windows, side entrance, window blinds, built in storage, floor aera 67m², BER E, Ground Floor – Entrance Hall, living room, back kitchen, guest w.c. First Floor – 2no. bedrooms, living room, bathroom."
      },
